      <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="must be using the east entrance">must be using the east entrance</button>
      <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="might need a second cooling room">might need a second cooling room</button>
      <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="said the translated signs were here beside us">said the translated signs were here beside us</button>
    </div>
    <div class="q"><span class="n">1</span><span>A live website notice is being read now and its status is current: The notice <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="says the west branch is open today" data-hint="Use the current reporting verb says and keep the current day reference." data-fix="The notice says the west branch is open today." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button>.</span></div>
