    <div class="q"><span class="n">3</span><span>Omar spoke on June 11: <span class="ex">“I sent the inspection file yesterday.”</span> The calendar shows that <span class="ex">yesterday</span> meant June 10. Jordan reports that Omar <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="had sent the inspection file on June 10" data-hint="Use Past Perfect for the earlier sending and replace the shifting word yesterday with the known date." data-fix="Omar said he had sent the inspection file on June 10." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button>.</span></div>
